  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8c8072d2125b034db50ac10816f2018, type: 3}
  m_Name: landmark_6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text1: "Tu tombes sur un livre dont les pages semblent raconter exactement ce que
    tu as pens\xE9 jusqu'\xE0 aujourd'hui, sauf deux pages."
  text2: "La premi\xE8re raconte une trahison que tu as v\xE9cue sans le savoir."
  text3: "La deuxi\xE8me d\xE9crit un avenir possible dont tu ne veux pas."
  text4: Tu ne peux lire qu'une seule page, laquelle choisis-tu ?
  text5: 
  text6: 
  answer1: Trahison
  answer2: Avenir
  text1_EN: You come across a book whose pages seem to recount exactly what you have
    thought up until today, except for two pages.
  text2_EN: The first describes a betrayal you experienced without knowing it.
  text3_EN: The second describes a possible future that you do not want.
  text4_EN: You can only read one page. Which one do you choose?
  text5_EN: 
  text6_EN: 
  answer1_EN: Betrayal
  answer2_EN: Future
  type: 1
  nbTexts: 3
